# Shared design system. Quickshell blocks '..' in QML imports, so every
# module carries a `common -> ../common` symlink and does `import "./common"`.
# New module: ln -sfn ../common <name>/common
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Sys 1.0 Sys.qml
Cluster 1.0 Cluster.qml
Meter 1.0 Meter.qml
Bracket 1.0 Bracket.qml
Corners 1.0 Corners.qml
Tag 1.0 Tag.qml
Panel 1.0 Panel.qml
Btn 1.0 Btn.qml
Wheel 1.0 Wheel.qml
Standby 1.0 Standby.qml
Scanlines 1.0 Scanlines.qml
ChamferBox 1.0 ChamferBox.qml
GlitchText 1.0 GlitchText.qml
DynamicPill 1.0 DynamicPill.qml
Pip 1.0 Pip.qml
Readout 1.0 Readout.qml
